# nexusq-kernel-ota promotion enablement (systemd preset).
#
# Shipped by the aport itself (same rationale as 96-nexusq-mqtt.preset): the
# image build runs `systemctl preset-all` and 99-default's `disable *` would
# strip a vendor unit's enable symlink, so declare it here at priority 97
# (after 95-nexusq/96-mqtt, before 99-default).
#
# The unit costs a normal boot nothing — with no trial kernel in flight
# `nq-kernel-ota autopromote` exits 0 immediately. It only does work on the one
# boot that follows a `try`, which is exactly when nobody can be relied on to be
# watching: the whole point is that the trial gets promoted or abandoned by
# itself, and the reboot reason gets disarmed either way.
enable nexusq-kernel-ota-promote.service
